---
title: Order Management Flow - Complete Lifecycle
config:
  theme: default
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant MA as Mobile App
    participant API as OrdrMate API
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant PM as Paymob Gateway
    participant OM as Order Manager
    participant KS as Kitchen Service
    participant TS as Table Service
    participant WS as WebSocket Handler
    participant BM as Branch Manager
    participant FCM as Firebase Messaging

    Note over C, FCM: Order Placement Phase
    C->>MA: Browse menu & select items
    MA->>API: GET /api/item/restaurant/{id}
    API->>OS: GetAvailableItems()
    OS-->>API: Available items list
    API-->>MA: Menu items response
    
    C->>MA: Add items to cart & place order
    MA->>API: POST /api/order (PlaceOrderDto)
    API->>+OS: CreateOrderIntent()
    
    alt Dine-in Order
        OS->>TS: ReserveTable()
        TS->>OM: CalculateWaitingTime()
        OM-->>TS: Estimated waiting time
        TS-->>OS: Table reservation details
    end
    
    OS->>OS: CreateOrderIntent entity
    OS-->>-API: OrderIntentDto with payment URL
    API-->>MA: Order intent response

    Note over C, FCM: Payment Phase
    MA->>PM: Redirect to payment gateway
    C->>PM: Complete payment
    PM->>API: POST /webhook/paymob (payment confirmation)
    API->>+PS: ProcessPaymentWebhook()
    PS->>OS: ProceedTransaction()
    
    OS->>+OM: ConfirmOrder()
    OM->>OM: Add order to kitchen queues
    
    alt Dine-in Order
        OM->>TS: FinalizeTableReservation()
        TS->>TS: Update table status
    else Takeaway Order
        OM->>OM: Generate takeaway number
    end
    
    OM->>WS: NotifyBranchUpdate()
    WS->>BM: Real-time order notification
    OM->>FCM: SendCustomerNotification()
    FCM->>C: Order confirmation push
    OM-->>-OS: Order confirmation
    OS-->>PS: Transaction completed
    
    Note over C, FCM: Kitchen Processing Phase
    BM->>API: GET /api/order/item_queues/{branchId}
    API->>OM: GetItemQueues()
    OM-->>API: Current kitchen queues
    API-->>BM: Kitchen queue status
    
    loop For each kitchen unit
        BM->>API: POST /api/order/check-prepared/{branchId}/{kitchen}/{unit}
        API->>+OM: CheckPreparedInQueue()
        OM->>OM: Move item to next in queue
        OM->>WS: NotifyQueueUpdate()
        WS->>BM: Updated queue status
        OM-->>-API: Queue update response
    end
    
    Note over C, FCM: Order Completion Phase
    OM->>OM: Check if all items ready
    alt All Items Ready
        OM->>OS: UpdateOrderStatus(Ready)
        OM->>FCM: NotifyCustomerOrderReady()
        FCM->>C: Order ready notification
        OM->>WS: NotifyBranchOrderReady()
        WS->>BM: Order ready notification
    end
    
    Note over C, FCM: Order Pickup/Delivery Phase
    alt Takeaway Order
        C->>MA: Arrive at restaurant
        MA->>API: PUT /api/order/pick/{orderId}
        API->>OS: PickOrder()
        OS->>OS: Generate invoice
        OS->>OS: UpdateOrderStatus(Delivered)
        OS-->>API: Order invoice
        API-->>MA: Pickup confirmation
    else Dine-in Order
        BM->>API: Manually mark as served
        API->>OS: UpdateOrderStatus(Delivered)
        TS->>TS: Mark table as available
        TS->>WS: NotifyTableAvailable()
        WS->>BM: Table status update
    end
    
    Note over C, FCM: Post-Order Management
    OM->>OM: Update restaurant analytics
    OM->>OM: Update kitchen performance metrics
    
    alt Table Reservation Queue
        TS->>TS: Process next reservation in queue
        TS->>FCM: NotifyNextCustomerInQueue()
        FCM->>C: Table ready notification
    end

    Note over C, FCM: Error Handling Scenarios
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note right of PM: Payment Failed
        PM->>API: Payment failure webhook
        API->>PS: HandlePaymentFailure()
        PS->>OS: CancelOrderIntent()
        OS->>TS: ReleaseTableReservation()
        OS->>FCM: NotifyPaymentFailure()
        FCM->>C: Payment failed notification
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note right of OM: Kitchen Unavailable
        OM->>KS: CheckKitchenAvailability()
        KS-->>OM: Kitchen offline/maintenance
        OM->>OS: DelayOrder()
        OM->>FCM: NotifyOrderDelay()
        FCM->>C: Order delay notification
    end
